      "reading": "Almost all DETECTABLE control-vs-tile signal in this embedding is LINEARLY encoded, so the 32-dim linear subspace removal reached nearly all of it. The 'nonlinear survives' caveat shrinks from an open loophole to about one AUROC point of unreachable headroom.",
